      "items": [
        "Approved product contract after permanent Teamwork removal (2026-11-07), not a committed implementation snapshot. Edges mean containment, not redirects.",
        "Milestone panels, Review editors and AI chat stay in-page; API routes and private file streams are not HTML pages.",
        "Calendar reads existing Tasks, Milestones and Goals; it adds no calendar store."
      ]
